    "text": "We did work out together actually and, and, uh, it's kinda fun to have a reason to work out and, and get in shape. It's hard when you, you know, you're doing a job and there's no time to go to the gym. A lot of people find it hard to actually just fit it into their schedule. It's not'cause they're lazy or they don't wanna work out, it's just like, \"When do I do that? When do I dedicate that amount of time?\" But when it's part of your job, it's joyous. So yeah, we got in, uh, in good shape in the California sunshine, didn't we?",
